[[File:Angel Room door.png|130px]]

'''Angel Rooms''' are the divine equivalent of the {{R|Devil Room}}. They feature an angel and 0-4 free items. Taking one of these items causes all other free items to disappear. ({{c|Tainted Keeper}} still needs to pay for these items, and buying any of them causes all of the others to disappear. Some of these items cost 30 pennies to buy.)

Every time the Devil Room is spawned/entered, there's a chance for it to be replaced by the Angel Room if certain conditions are met. After beating the {{s|Dark Room}} or {{s|Chest}} once, an [[Angel]] can be awoken by planting a bomb near the statue (or destroying it with {{i|Leo}} or similar items). This will begin an angel boss fight and allow Isaac to charge his active item and pick up {{i|Key Piece 1}} or {{i|Key Piece 2}}. Both pieces are needed to get through the Golden Door in {{S|Chest}} or {{S|Dark Room}} to fight {{E|Mega Satan}}.

